           "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the eight components of $\\\\Psi_{\\\\rm LL}$: components \
1 and 2 are the first Dirac component with isospin up and down, 3 and 4 the \
second, 5 and 6 the third, 7 and 8 the fourth; $\\\\Psi^-_{\\\\rm LL}$ \
(components 1 to 4, chirality $-1$) and $\\\\Psi^+_{\\\\rm LL}$ (components 5 \
to 8, chirality $+1$) are the two Weyl isodoublets; $\\\\bar\\\\Psi_{\\\\rm \
LL}=\\\\Psi^\\\\dagger_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\gamma^0_{\\\\rm \
LL}\\\\otimes\\\\sigma^{\\\\rm LL}_0)$ is the Dirac adjoint\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
