like $\\\\Psi_{\\\\rm LL}$ and $\\\\psi^{\\\\rm h}_{\\\\rm LL}$ like \
$\\\\Psi^*_{\\\\rm LL}$; a component is written $\\\\psi^{\\\\rm p}_{{\\\\rm \
LL},k}$, and a numbered mode $(\\\\psi^{\\\\rm p}_{{\\\\rm LL},n},\\\\psi^{\\\
\\rm h}_{{\\\\rm LL},n})$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
