upper left block $h^\\\\nabla_{\\\\rm LL}-i\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm LL}_0-\\\\mathsf \
A_{{\\\\rm LL},0}-\\\\mu_{\\\\rm LL}$, the upper right block $\\\\mathsf \
P_{\\\\rm LL}$, the lower left block $\\\\mathsf P_{\\\\rm LL}^\\\\dagger$ \
and the lower right block $-(h^\\\\nabla_{\\\\rm LL}-i\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm \
LL}_0-\\\\mathsf A_{{\\\\rm LL},0}-\\\\mu_{\\\\rm LL})^*$, with the covariant \
Dirac Hamiltonian $h^\\\\nabla_{\\\\rm LL}=-i\\\\sum_j\\\\alpha^j_{\\\\rm LL}\
\\\\nabla^{\\\\rm LL}_j+\\\\beta_{\\\\rm LL}m_{\\\\rm LL}$ \
($\\\\alpha^j_{\\\\rm LL}$ and $\\\\beta_{\\\\rm LL}$ acting on the Dirac \
index); on a plane wave $\\\\exp(i\\\\sum_jq^j_{\\\\rm LL}x^j_{\\\\rm LL})$ \
with constant fields it is a $16\\\\times16$ matrix $\\\\mathcal H^{\\\\rm \
DB}_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\vec q_{\\\\rm LL})$ (plain text `H_DB(q)`), which without \
gauge fields equals $\\\\mathsf H_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\vec q_{\\\\rm LL})$\>\""}], 
         ",", " ", 
