momentum of both members of a pair\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "189"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm \
f'}_{\\\\rm LL}$; $\\\\delta^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<u_f\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<delta_f\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<a fixed complex unit vector, the direction of a deviation \
$\\\\delta^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}(x_{\\\\rm LL})\\\\,\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\
\\rm LL}$ of the field from the vacuum $(0,0,\\\\Delta_{\\\\rm LL})$, one of \
the six directions $(1,0,0)$, $(0,1,0)$, $(0,0,i)$ (Goldstone) and $(i,0,0)$, \
$(0,i,0)$, $(0,0,1)$ (massive); a second such direction; and the small real \
amplitude of the deviation, a function of space and time\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "190"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\mathsf H^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $\\\\mathsf \
H^{\\\\rm f'}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "\"\<H_f\>\"", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the change of the $16\\\\times16$ Bogoliubov matrix per \
unit of $\\\\delta^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $\\\\begin{pmatrix}0&\\\\mathsf \
P_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL})\\\\\\\\\\\\mathsf P_{\\\\rm \
LL}(\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL})^\\\\dagger&0\\\\end{pmatrix}$, where \
$\\\\mathsf P_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL})$ is the pairing \
block with $\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}$ in place of $\\\\vec d_{\\\\rm \
LL}$; and the same for $\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f'}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "191"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\chi^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm \
B}_{\\\\rm LL})$, $\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm \
B}_{\\\\rm LL})$; $\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm G}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm m}_{\
\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<chi_f\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Gamma_f\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<Gamma_bdg\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Gamma_G\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<Gamma_m\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the pair susceptibility of a direction $\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm \
f}_{\\\\rm LL}$ of the condensed vacuum at the frequency $\\\\omega^{\\\\rm \
B}_{\\\\rm LL}$ and zero wave number, and the kernel of the direction, \
$\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}=\\\\lvert\\\\vec u^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}\\\
\\rvert^2/G_{\\\\rm LL}-\\\\chi^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL}$: minus the \
coefficient of the time average of $(\\\\delta^{\\\\rm f}_{\\\\rm LL})^2$ in \
the effective action per duration and volume (plain text `Gamma_bdg`: the \
kernel computed from the Bogoliubov matrices); the kernels of the three \
Goldstone directions and of the three massive directions, $\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm \
G}_{\\\\rm LL}=-(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm LL})^2\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}$ \
and $\\\\Gamma^{\\\\rm m}_{\\\\rm LL}=(4\\\\Delta_{\\\\rm \
LL}^2-(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm LL})^2)\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "192"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm \
LL})$, $\\\\Upsilon^{(1)}_{\\\\rm LL}$; $c^{\\\\rm w}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<Upsilon\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Upsilon_1\>\""}], 
           "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the common factor of the kernels of the condensed vacuum, \
$\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}=2\\\\int_{q_{\\\\rm LL}<\\\\Lambda_{\\\\rm \
LL}}d^3q_{\\\\rm LL}(2\\\\pi)^{-3}\\\\big(E^{\\\\rm c}_{\\\\rm \
LL}(4(E^{\\\\rm c}_{\\\\rm LL})^2-(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm \
LL})^2)\\\\big)^{-1}$, with $\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}(0)=Z^{\\\\rm t}_{\\\\rm \
LL}(\\\\Delta_{\\\\rm LL})$; its derivative with respect to \
$(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm LL})^2$ at zero; and the positive number \
$c^{\\\\rm w}_{\\\\rm LL}=(M^{\\\\rm q}_{\\\\rm LL})^2-(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm \
B}_{\\\\rm LL})^2/4$, used in the proof that the kernels of the Goldstone and \
of the massive directions are $-(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm \
LL})^2\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}$ and $(4\\\\Delta_{\\\\rm \
LL}^2-(\\\\omega^{\\\\rm B}_{\\\\rm LL})^2)\\\\Upsilon_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "193"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\vec d^{\\\\rm u}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the SFBS field in the unitary gauge, the column of the \
SFBSv parametrization, $(i\\\\,c^{\\\\rm n}_{{\\\\rm \
LL},1},\\\\,i\\\\,c^{\\\\rm n}_{{\\\\rm LL},2},\\\\,\\\\Delta^{\\\\rm \
vac}_{\\\\rm LL}+h^{\\\\rm a}_{\\\\rm LL})$: the field after the gauge \
transformation that removes the three Goldstone fields\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "194"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$V^{\\\\rm F}_{{\\\\rm LL},p}$, $V^\\\\iota_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<V\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<V^iota\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<VF\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the gauge potentials in the unitary gauge, the vector \
fields of definite mass: $V^{\\\\rm F}_{{\\\\rm LL},p}=A^{\\\\rm F}_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}-\\\\partial_p\\\\vartheta^{\\\\rm G}_{{\\\\rm LL},0}/g^{\\\\rm \
F}_{\\\\rm LL}$ and $\\\\sum_\\\\iota V^\\\\iota_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}\\\\tau^{\\\\rm LL}_\\\\iota/2=(\\\\mathsf U^{\\\\rm G}_{\\\\rm LL})^\\\
\\dagger\\\\mathsf a_{{\\\\rm LL},p}\\\\mathsf U^{\\\\rm G}_{\\\\rm \
LL}-(i/g^{\\\\rm v}_{\\\\rm LL})(\\\\partial_p(\\\\mathsf U^{\\\\rm \
G}_{\\\\rm LL})^\\\\dagger)\\\\mathsf U^{\\\\rm G}_{\\\\rm LL}$; to first \
order $V^\\\\iota_{{\\\\rm LL},p}=A^\\\\iota_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}-\\\\partial_p\\\\vartheta^{\\\\rm G}_{{\\\\rm LL},\\\\iota}/g^{\\\\rm \
v}_{\\\\rm LL}$ ($\\\\iota=1,2$) and $V^3_{{\\\\rm LL},p}=A^3_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}$, the photon\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "195"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$W^\\\\pm_{{\\\\rm LL},p}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<W_+\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<W_-\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the charged massive vector fields, $(V^1_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}\\\\mp iV^2_{{\\\\rm LL},p})/\\\\sqrt2$, of the electric charges \
$\\\\pm1$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "196"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\mathsf M^{\\\\rm t}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $\\\\mathsf \
M^{\\\\rm s}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the mass matrices of the time and of the space components \
of the four vector fields $(V^{\\\\rm F}_{{\\\\rm LL},p},V^1_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p},V^2_{{\\\\rm LL},p},V^3_{{\\\\rm LL},p})$ in the vacuum: $2Z^{\\\\rm \
t}_{\\\\rm LL}$ and $2Z^{\\\\rm s}_{\\\\rm LL}$ times the contact matrix of \
the vacuum, ${\\\\rm diag}(4(g^{\\\\rm F}_{\\\\rm LL})^2,(g^{\\\\rm \
v}_{\\\\rm LL})^2,(g^{\\\\rm v}_{\\\\rm LL})^2,0)(\\\\Delta^{\\\\rm \
vac}_{\\\\rm LL})^2$; the quadratic Lagrangian contains one half of the first \
and minus one half of the second, each between the row and the column of the \
components\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "197"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$M^{\\\\rm W}_{\\\\rm LL}$, $M^{\\\\rm F}_{\\\\rm \
LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<M_W\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<M_F\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<M_W_time\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<M_F_time\>\""}], "}"}]}], 
         ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the rest masses of the charged vector fields $W^\\\\pm_{{\
\\\\rm LL},p}$ and of the fermion-number vector field $V^{\\\\rm F}_{{\\\\rm \
LL},p}$, $(M^{\\\\rm W}_{\\\\rm LL})^2=2Z^{\\\\rm s}_{\\\\rm LL}(g^{\\\\rm \
v}_{\\\\rm LL})^2(\\\\Delta^{\\\\rm vac}_{\\\\rm LL})^2$ and $(M^{\\\\rm F}_{\
\\\\rm LL})^2=8Z^{\\\\rm s}_{\\\\rm LL}(g^{\\\\rm F}_{\\\\rm \
LL})^2(\\\\Delta^{\\\\rm vac}_{\\\\rm LL})^2$ (plain text `M_W_time`, \
`M_F_time`: the masses of the time components, with $Z^{\\\\rm t}_{\\\\rm \
LL}$ in place of $Z^{\\\\rm s}_{\\\\rm LL}$)\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "198"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\theta^{\\\\rm mix}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<theta_mix\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<theta_mix_vacuum\>\"", 
            ",", " ", "\"\<theta_mix_saddle\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<theta_mix_pred\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the mixing angle: the angle between the massless gauge \
field (the null vector of the mass matrix) and the axis of the potential \
$A^3_{{\\\\rm LL},p}$ in the plane of $A^{\\\\rm F}_{{\\\\rm LL},p}$ and \
$A^3_{{\\\\rm LL},p}$; zero in the vacuum, $\\\\arctan(g^{\\\\rm v}_{\\\\rm \
LL}/(2g^{\\\\rm F}_{\\\\rm LL}))$ at the non-unitary saddle point (plain \
text: the values found at the vacuum and at the saddle point, and the \
prediction)\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}], ",", "\n", 
       RowBox[{"<|", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"\"\<entry\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "199"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<group\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<9 Test 2: the gauge-covariant field equations of the \
spinor field and their solutions\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<symbol\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<$\\\\mathcal L^{(2)}_{\\\\rm LL}$\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<names\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaning\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<the part of the second order, in the fields of SFBSv and \
the gauge potentials, of the effective Lagrangian of the superfluid boson \
singlet state together with the Yang-Mills and Maxwell terms of the gauge \
fields\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"\"\<meaningEdited\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
         
         RowBox[{"\"\<origin\>\"", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<new (Revision_SuperLoop)\>\""}]}], "|>"}]}], "\n", 
      "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n", "\n", 
   RowBox[{"Length", "[", "SL31Registry", "]"}]}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"b3b66ccf-09d8-43bd-8310-dbb667c1c65a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "the", " ", "number", " ", "of", " ", "entries", " ", "in", " ", "each", " ",
     "of", " ", "the", " ", "nine", " ", "groups"}], " ", "*)"}], "\n", 
  RowBox[{"KeySort", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Counts", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"#", "[", "\"\<group\>\"", "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
